<title>PHILIPPINES: Concrete Aggregates sets date on stock div.</title>
<headline>Concrete Aggregates sets date on stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concrete Aggregates Corp said on Tuesday it had set March 15, 1997 as the record date for its 57.25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>It declared the stock dividend in April 1995.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
